{"3478110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "文庙满庭雪", "steam_appid": 3478110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ode to Snow is inspired by the architecture of the Temple of Confucius and features a Chinese style.It is a faithful recreation of ancient Chinese architecture, with traditional Chinese painting elements cleverly integrated throughout, allowing players to enjoy the unique visual charm of pixel art and the oriental atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unravel the mystery, players will rely on the Jade Scroll and Notebook. Travelling between fairies with different personalities and solving numerous intricate mechanisms, they will gradually piece together fragments of history and uncover the long-lost secrets buried within the Temple of Confucius.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.poster.avif?t=1764380017\" width=400 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.webm?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.mp4?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve puzzles, explore game mechanisms and collect broken pieces of a bronze mirror to find their way back to the real world. The clues to solving the puzzles reveal the love-hate relationship between two elves, and as you escape from the inner world, the past gradually comes to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.poster.avif?t=1764380017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.webm?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.mp4?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.poster.avif?t=1764380017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.webm?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.mp4?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How is the Temple of Confucius connected to the world beyond? What is the secret of the jade scroll given by Song Ming, the Pine Tree Elf? What is the origin of the uneasy relationship between humans and elves? The answers to these puzzles are related not only to the survival of the Inner World, but also to an obsession that transcends time itself.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ode to Snow is inspired by the architecture of the Temple of Confucius and features a Chinese style.It is a faithful recreation of ancient Chinese architecture, with traditional Chinese painting elements cleverly integrated throughout, allowing players to enjoy the unique visual charm of pixel art and the oriental atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unravel the mystery, players will rely on the Jade Scroll and Notebook. Travelling between fairies with different personalities and solving numerous intricate mechanisms, they will gradually piece together fragments of history and uncover the long-lost secrets buried within the Temple of Confucius.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.poster.avif?t=1764380017\" width=400 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.webm?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/e9c504eb13c7d4efce8b303d71985bcb.mp4?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve puzzles, explore game mechanisms and collect broken pieces of a bronze mirror to find their way back to the real world. The clues to solving the puzzles reveal the love-hate relationship between two elves, and as you escape from the inner world, the past gradually comes to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.poster.avif?t=1764380017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.webm?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/58286d0d1690d73f06339d62da9d6ea5.mp4?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.poster.avif?t=1764380017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.webm?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/extras/15e5ce8ec3ea372afca64fe93641bccc.mp4?t=1764380017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How is the Temple of Confucius connected to the world beyond? What is the secret of the jade scroll given by Song Ming, the Pine Tree Elf? What is the origin of the uneasy relationship between humans and elves? The answers to these puzzles are related not only to the survival of the Inner World, but also to an obsession that transcends time itself.</p>", "short_description": "This third-person puzzle RPG is set in a world ruled by elves. Your mission is to rescue your friend, unveil the secrets of the elves' bronze mirror and jade scroll, and record the enigmas you encounter in your notebook. To solve puzzles, you will explore the temple, use tools and talk to elves.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/664fd3113eff47b895b162dfd41eb6511253a12c/header.jpg?t=1764380017", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478110/950a0c18bd73489101fcc148c9a1e60885998a48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764380017", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste